# Notifier

Generated by CIaC (Java / Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21).

## Run locally

```sh
./mvnw spring-boot:run
```

## Build and test

```sh
./mvnw -q -B verify
```

## Docker

```sh
docker compose up --build
```
